   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the labor law, in relation to establishing the warehouse\nworker protection act; and to amend a chapter of the laws of 2022 amending the\nlabor law relating to establishing the warehouse worker protection act, as\nproposed in legislative bills numbers S. 8922-A and A. 10020-A, in relation to\nthe effectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S851",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S851-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§218, 780, 781 & 784 - 787, Lab L; amd §5, Chap of 2022 (as proposed in S.8922-A & A.10020-A)",
    "lawSection": "Labor Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S851\n\nSPONSOR: RAMOS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the labor law, in relation to establishing the warehouse\nworker protection act; and to amend a chapter of the laws of 2022 amend-\ning the labor law relating to establishing the warehouse worker\nprotection act, as proposed in legislative bills numbers S. 8922-A and\nA.  10020-A, in relation to the effectiveness thereof\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThis is a chapter amendment that makes changes to provisions of L.2022,\nc.722, to clarify provisions relating to establishing the warehouse\nworker protection act.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nThis legislation amends the underlying chapter by clarifying terms to\nensure that the bill's provisions apply to warehouse workers. This\nlegislation also clarifies requests for quota information and responding\nto such requests, clarifies the anti-retaliation provisions, addresses\nemployee language access, and allows more time for employers to effec-\ntively implement these provisions.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nPursuant to approval memo 44 of the laws of 2022, this legislation is a\nnegotiated change to the underlying chapter.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nChapter amendment to chapter 722 of the Laws of 2022. S.8922-A and\nA.10020-A both passed the Senate and Assembly, respectively, in June\n2022.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately; provided, however, that sections\none and two of this act shall take effect on the same date and in the\nsame manner as a chapter of the laws of 2022 amending the labor law\nrelating to establishing the warehouse worker protection act, as\nproposed in legislative bill numbers S.8922-A and A.10020-A, takes\neffect.\n",
